crafter.25=Keep your tools close and the work goes more smoothly. I have shared my toolbox plans with the town. Your crafters can make a set for each Apprentice who needs one.
crafter.50=I have shared the toolbox plans with the town. Your crafters can now make a set for each Apprentice who needs one.
crafter.75=These pattern cabinet plans will help your workshop stay organized. Have an Apprentice build one and place it inside a Crafting workplace. It helps the worker finish sooner. More cabinets in the same site give no extra benefit.
leatherworker.25=A sharp awl and good thread save a lot of trouble. I have shared my tool roll plans with the town. Your leatherworkers can make one at a tanning rack.
leatherworker.50=I have shared my tool roll plans with the town. Your leatherworkers can make more at a tanning rack.
leatherworker.75=I trust you with my stitching frame plans. Have an Apprentice build one for a Leatherworking site. It keeps the work steady and saves time. A second frame in the same site gives no extra benefit.
